にそれを考えるのですか。\n学生Ｂ. （⑥）は（⑦）の前提要件であることから客観的に判断すべきであり，それゆえ，（⑧）を基準にすべきと考えます。\n学生Ａ．そうすると，私の見解でも，（⑤）の有無の判断の基礎となる事情の一つとして，行為の時点において（⑧）が認識可能であった事情を考慮するので，あなたの見解と変わりはないのではないですか。"},{"kind":"語句群","text":"ア．故意\nイ．過失\nウ．注意義務\nエ．期待可能性\nオ．予見可能性\nカ．一般人\nキ．行為者\nク．因果関係\nケ．条件関係\nコ．実行行為性\nサ．相当因果関係\nシ．責任主義\nス．法益保護主義"}],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":true,"choices":[{"number":1,"text":"①ク ⑤コ","blanks":[{"blank":1,"word":"ク"},{"blank":5,"word":"コ"}]},{"number":2,"text":"②ス ④ケ","blanks":[{"blank":2,"word":"ス"},{"blank":4,"word":"ケ"}]},{"number":3,"text":"②シ ⑦ア","blanks":[{"blank":2,"word":"シ"},{"blank":7,"word":"ア"}]},{"number":4,"text":"③イ ⑧カ","blanks":[{"blank":3,"word":"イ"},{"blank":8,"word":"カ"}]},{"number":5,"text":"⑤サ ⑥エ","blanks":[{"blank":5,"word":"サ"},{"blank":6,"word":"エ"}]}],"answer_slots":[{"no":6,"official_answer":4}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":[],"statement_truth_derivable":false,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R02-2020/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R02-2020/刑法刑事訴訟法_正答.pdf","page":4,"line_range":[99,128],"extraction":"pdftotext"},"flags":[]},{"id":"yobi-2020-keiho-q06","exam":{"type":"yobi","year":2020,"era":"R02"},"subject":"keiho","number":6,"points":2,"format":"single_choice","polarity":"correct","exhaustive":false,"unordered":false,"stem":"住居侵入等の罪に関する次の１から５までの各記述を判例の立場に従って検討した場合，正しいものはどれか。（解答欄は，［№７］）","context":[],"sub_questions":[],"requires_context":false,"choices":[],"answer_slots":[{"no":7,"official_answer":2}],"scoring":{"partial_credit":null,"no_partial_credit":false,"raw_note":""},"status":{"voided":false,"all_correct":false,"errata":[]},"statements":["yobi-2020-keiho-q06-1","yobi-2020-keiho-q06-2","yobi-2020-keiho-q06-3","yobi-2020-keiho-q06-4","yobi-2020-keiho-q06-5"],"statement_truth_derivable":true,"provenance":{"question_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R02-2020/刑法刑事訴訟法_問題.pdf","answer_pdf":"data/raw/予備試験/短答/R02-202